Package: axon-game-mode
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Axon OS <axon-os@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: gamemode, python3, python3-dbus
Section: games
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ProjectDEV-git/Axon-OS
Description: Axon OS game mode command and GameMode hooks
 Installs the axon-game-mode command and the GameMode configuration that runs
 it, so starting a game through gamemoderun, Steam or Lutris pauses the AI
 services (see org.axonos.Gaming) and ending it brings them back.
